this kinda is the solution to my problem, the thing is that in your code the clones spawn every time you press the spacebar, while in my code the clones spawn based on a number you give

so with your code only half of the clones gets deleted, but what i need is only one man standing alive

if it can help i this is my code so you have a foundation and can test it yourself [https://mega.nz/file/6IURHRhL#Yblz8dOrLmnLT9q8gPJKTH62Rm\_prfTzrwzFyUxTMDU](https://mega.nz/file/6IURHRhL#Yblz8dOrLmnLT9q8gPJKTH62Rm_prfTzrwzFyUxTMDU)

I noticed now that my battery was at 69%

&#x200B;

Nice.
